    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Price affects demand</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Higher price means more profit! But lower sales frequency... so decrease price to sell faster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861560/extras/9876e2bc082c9fd6fd106097e4264d69.poster.avif?t=1748015532\" width=330 height=102 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861560/extras/9876e2bc082c9fd6fd106097e4264d69.webm?t=1748015532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861560/extras/9876e2bc082c9fd6fd106097e4264d69.mp4?t=1748015532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >But remember to recoup your costs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ingredients costs money, so remember to take enough profits to invest in more lemonades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861560/extras/771072097393a9184496f7c21bd1c313.avif?t=1748015532\" width=562 height=392 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrades reduce cost and increase demand</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you can buy upgrades to grow lemons, sugar fields, and more! Making them free to produce. Also you can increase demand by buying distribution methods!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861560/extras/10f0c40318f9f6b25d1f4ce84a957b57.avif?t=1748015532\" width=526 height=280 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Three unique levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a story based clicker, there are three different levels with unique upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861560/extras/532912c223c980189b8fb96ec9616eb3.poster.avif?t=1748015532\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861560/extras/532912c223c980189b8fb96ec9616eb3.webp?t=1748015532\" class=\"bb_img\" width=460 height=215 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No in-app purchases</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a short subject, hence it's free!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pssst..!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861560/extras/a7fed04aca8f1e3abf8fccbd34dc992f.avif?t=1748015532\" width=500 height=200 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Price affects demand</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Higher price means more profit! But lower sales frequency... so decrease price to sell faster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861560/extras/9876e2bc082c9fd6fd106097e4264d69.poster.avif?t=1748015532\" width=330 height=102 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861560/extras/9876e2bc082c9fd6fd106097e4264d69.webm?t=1748015532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861560/extras/9876e2bc082c9fd6fd106097e4264d69.mp4?t=1748015532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >But remember to recoup your costs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ingredients costs money, so remember to take enough profits to invest in more lemonades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861560/extras/771072097393a9184496f7c21bd1c313.avif?t=1748015532\" width=562 height=392 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrades reduce cost and increase demand</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you can buy upgrades to grow lemons, sugar fields, and more! Making them free to produce. Also you can increase demand by buying distribution methods!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861560/extras/10f0c40318f9f6b25d1f4ce84a957b57.avif?t=1748015532\" width=526 height=280 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Three unique levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a story based clicker, there are three different levels with unique upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861560/extras/532912c223c980189b8fb96ec9616eb3.poster.avif?t=1748015532\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861560/extras/532912c223c980189b8fb96ec9616eb3.webp?t=1748015532\" class=\"bb_img\" width=460 height=215 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No in-app purchases</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a short subject, hence it's free!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pssst..!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861560/extras/a7fed04aca8f1e3abf8fccbd34dc992f.avif?t=1748015532\" width=500 height=200 /></span></p>",
